{"product_id":"a-voyage-through-air-the-queen-of-dreams","title":"A Voyage Through Air (The Queen of Dreams)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWar is coming—and every leader of every realm has sided with the War Emperor and pledged to fight the Karrak invaders—apart from Taggie, the teenage Queen of Dreams-to-be. Aided by an unusual band of allies, including a Karrak Lord, an elf and a feisty skyfolk captain, Taggie knows that the only way to stop the war is to find the long-lost gateway between our universe and the dark universe: the home of the Karrak people. But how much is Taggie willing to lose in her desperate quest for peace?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Peter F. Hamilton\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781447291169\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45659182071961,"sku":"6RC9781447291169","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68a69bb72aaf8_A_Voyage_Through_Air__The_Queen_of_Dreams__Peter_F._Hamilton_183b0a4c-671c-4826-8797-8b0d47e3097c.jpg?v=1755763914","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/a-voyage-through-air-the-queen-of-dreams","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}